# Pinned SHA-256 of every release asset prepare.sh downloads: "<sha256>  <release>/<asset>".
# Computed from the exact assets, and cross-checked against what the releases publish: each
# polkadot-sdk asset against its `<asset>.sha256`, the Kreivo wasm against the `sha256` in
# `kreivo_runtime-srtool-digest.json` (srtool build of commit 87f8728). Bumping KREIVO_RELEASE or
# PSDK_RELEASE means adding its lines here; prepare.sh refuses an asset with no pinned line.
